!! gate ~ read

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`read` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the filter computes over the reader's view, so the gate stands inside the engine; it writes nothing`>>
```

