<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ filter-malformed · filter-cursor-stale · filter-context-alone · wiki-unreached · wiki-not-anchored · cross-face-private · face-not-open

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`filter-malformed` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.pages filter/<filter> recipe/default]] ~ the engine cannot parse the filter; its words ride the refusal`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`filter-cursor-stale` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.pages filter/<filter> recipe/default]] ~ the wiki moved between pages; read again from the first page`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`filter-context-alone` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.pages filter/<filter> recipe/default match/<words> context/1]] ~ context shapes the lines match finds; name match beside it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`wiki-unreached` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.pages filter/<filter> recipe/default]] ~ no wiki this face hosts or holds a share of answers the slug`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`wiki-not-anchored` params=`cure/[[engine.filter.pages filter/<filter> recipe/default]] ~ a filter runs in a wiki's engine; a bag names no wiki`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`cross-face-private` params=`~ a visit reads another face's canon and working layer alone`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-open` params=`~ the face named stands shut; a visit reads a lit face alone`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ page · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`page` params=`exit/0 fields/[[recipe filter titles rows total next asOf withheld]] ~ one bounded page; next names the cursor of the page behind, null at the end`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/4 ~ the engine or the door refused by name; nothing ran past it`>>
```

